      "text": "We are hiring!\n\nThis may be the best time ever to join: we are incredibly bandwidth bottlenecked and there is a lot of support for almost any impactful misalignment work you can think of. I think we also have a pretty good epistemic environment and a very fun team \n\nTopics: all-things monitoring, misalignment & monitorability assessments, misalignment science, helping set up 3P auditing (e.g. recent Redwood collab), communicating risk externally (system cards/blogs, safety cases, etc)\n\nRSI/misalignment subteam: https://t.co/YHLMCYwWOe",
